                        "entry_id": "92512a53-a486-3e6a-8a89-a83d5ddbd5a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inferior or subservient breed of people or sentient beings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b783c92e-a461-4645-b690-dfd60c195cdd",
                                "sense_id": "02e345fa-99f5-3caa-a16d-dc9a2eeda4bc",
                                "text": "Leaf felt degraded by that — hiring on, in effect, as an indentured underbreed — but what choice was there for him?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec46ad0-1978-4740-b7fc-0a197c49b6e5",
                                "sense_id": "02e345fa-99f5-3caa-a16d-dc9a2eeda4bc",
                                "text": "I had an idea who it was but called the command post and demanded the names of the underbreeds who had last piloted the jet"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74689bd9-db88-4132-a339-41a3cebba1da",
                                "sense_id": "02e345fa-99f5-3caa-a16d-dc9a2eeda4bc",
                                "text": "Hi is thinking about those strange advertisements they read in the tabloid to titillate themselves, and the present in which he exists seems suddenly like some weird science fiction movie of the future in which the world is organized in a strange manner with certain people as an underbreed in which they are manipulated by economics to sell their bodies to others who live in another sphere where the repression of their carnality is required as an imagined requisite for social order."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
